{
 "time": "2026-10-07-203518Z",
 "commits": "eecb537 base (tree clean); arms are patches over it, built from copies of include/ and bench/",
 "purpose": "Four changes to schema::at proposed from the asm, each its own binary. floats.cbor element 30000 through S::at<\"$.values[30000]\">(msg) (MB_FIELD), cars and records one field through path + accessor::at, floats every field (MB_READ, MB_READ_VIEW). Arms: base; a = CBOR_ALWAYS_INLINE on schema::at; b = directory entry j+1 read unconditionally, end chosen by ?: (gcc sinks the load into a branch); b2 = b with a mask select (gcc emits cmovae); c = typed_array_length_read and item_length_read folded into item_reference_read, bounds as end < item + head; d = the 3-byte typed array head compared with one std::ranges::equal; ab, abc, abcd, abcd2 = a+b2+c+d cumulative. base.aa2 = base built a second time. FB_FIELD_V: FlatBuffers with Verifier. g++-16 only. Alternating in shuffled order, 10 rounds, min_time 0.2s, ns per call, real_time.",
